#X text 25 595 Mono wrapper for the hybrid rain model. All inlet messages go to rain~.;
#X text 25 625 Starts with density 0 Send bang for one drop or density N for automatic rain.;
#X text 25 655 clone instance number supplies a distinct seed. One mono signal outlet.;
#X text 25 685 The wrapper adds no effects. Hybrid layers and paper equations live inside rain~.;
